### http://www.hesge.ch/metafair/ontologies/fields#AuthoringTool
:AuthoringTool rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     core:Field ;
            core:fieldType "label" ;
            rdfs:label "Authoring tool"@en .


### http://www.hesge.ch/metafair/ontologies/fields#Discipline
:Discipline rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     core:Field ;
            core:fieldType "label" ;
            rdfs:label "Discipline"@en .

### http://www.hesge.ch/metafair/ontologies/fields#ModelViewDefinition
:ModelViewDefinition rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     core:Field ;
            core:fieldType "select" ;
            core:enumeratedValue "Coordination View 2.0	(IFC2x3)" ,
                                 "Reference View (IFC4)" ,
                                 "Design Transfer View (IFC4)" ;
            rdfs:label "Model View Definition"@en .